Get Job Orders At Home Only
To make the Worker get new job orders for performing a service at a station in the WorkerPool or at his
Home Location only, select this check box.
Remarks
A Worker, who is staying on a Workplace, for which the setting Worker Stays Here After Completing
the Job is activated, cannot be brokered in this case. You thus have to clear Worker Stays Here After
Completing the Job in all Workplaces so that brokering of the Workers works correctly.
Clear the check box, to allow the Worker to get his job orders anywhere, no matter if he walks freely in the
area or if he walks on a FootPath.
