Working Workers [WorkerPool]
Opens a list, which shows information pertaining to the working workers.
Remarks
The list shows:
• The Worker who provides a service or carries parts.
• The Location, i.e., the object on which the Worker is located at the moment. For a Worker walking freely
in the area, the WorkerPool is shown here.
• The Target station at which the Worker is to provide the service or carry the part to.
• The Service which the Worker currently provides. If the Worker carries parts, this is the service that was
provided while loading the part.
SimTalk
getWorkingWorkersTable [SimTalk]
